<p>I appreciate the feedback, in any case. Also, I've been getting a lot of confusion about why the first two paragraphs are the way they are. I was trying to establish who the main character is, and then tie his personality into the narration. It's overly obsessed about the issue because he himself is overly obsessed about it. Is it rude to be late? Sure. Is it THAT big a deal? No. But to Mr. Brashin, it's very important.</p>

